[h1]R.A.T.S. Pop-Out Windows[/h1]
[i]R.A.T.S. – Reconnaissance, Acoustics, Terrain & Signals[/i]

[b]Your windows, your way.[/b]
Windows that stay where you put them, snap, maximize and go see-through; one click throws them onto a second monitor.

[quote]▶ [b]Requires[/b] a mod loader: [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3835527459]R.A.T.S. Keel[/url] or Anchor Chain, either one
✉ Bugs, ideas, questions: [url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/popout]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url]
⭐ A favourite helps other captains find it[/quote]

[h2]✦ New in 1.2[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]One menu button[/b] in each window's title bar: pop out, window look, settings
[*][b]Runs on the 3D globe[/b] (0.9.x) and the flat map (0.8.7)
[/list]

[h2]✦ Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Second monitor in one click.[/b] The same menu entry brings it back; your desktop stays visible around the windows
[*][b]Windows that remember.[/b] Position and size kept, also after a restart
[*][b]Snap, maximize, see-through.[/b] Snap to edges and each other, double-click the title to maximize, opacity and scale per window
[*][b]An Encyclopedia that finds things.[/b] "Type 072" finds the Yukan class; real names for loadout variants
[*][b]Better unit panels.[/b] Full unit names, a Reference tab, right-click a flag for the unit's menu
[*][b]Every part has its own switch.[/b] Turn off whatever you don't want
[/list]

[h2]▶ Quick start[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Subscribe, and a mod loader if you have none (Keel above)
[*]Switch R.A.T.S. Pop-Out Windows on in Mods
[*]In a mission: the menu button in a window's title bar
[/olist]
[list]
[*][b]Second monitor:[/b] connect it before starting the game
[*][b]One monitor:[/b] everything but the pop-out works too
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Second monitor[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Which windows:[/b] formation manager, message log, unit status, camera, sensors, doctrine
[*][b]Over there[/b] only the windows show, and they can be bigger than the game allows
[*][b]Works next to[/b] the game's own second-monitor map and world view
[/list]

[h2]⚙ All windows[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Wide resize corners[/b] and proper resize cursors
[*][b]Window look:[/b] opacity, scale, text outline, below or above the others
[*][b]Desktops:[/b] Tab switches between window layouts (off by default)
[*][b]Settings[/b] in the same menu, in the game's nine languages
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Encyclopedia and missions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Encyclopedia:[/b] variants sorted by service date, "Armed only", a wider or hidden unit list, tooltips on weapon links, your search kept
[*][b]Time panel[/b] drags anywhere; a click on a corner-log message jumps to its unit
[*][b]Task Force Builder:[/b] loadouts oldest first, a "Strict loadouts" option
[*][b]Campaigns:[/b] damaged ships can be dismissed, the hull-swap price is fixed
[/list]

[h2]⚠ Good to know[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Windows only.[/b] A second monitor only for the pop-out part
[*][b]No game files are changed;[/b] missions and saves stay as they are
[/list]

[h2]⚙ Install and game versions[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Run in the game on 0.9.1[/b] (build 261112): Red Sea Breakout, under R.A.T.S. Keel
[*][b]Pop-out on the globe[/b] run on build 261107: formation manager and Sensor Views' radar scope on the second monitor
[*][b]0.8.7 (flat map):[/b] made for it, run there with earlier versions
[*][b]Settings:[/b] the menu's panel, or [i]BepInEx\config\dev.sewerlabs.seapowerpopout*.cfg[/i]
[*][b]More:[/b] [url=https://github.com/struckl/SeaPowerPopOut]README on GitHub[/url]
[/list]

[h2]✉ Problems, feedback, ideas[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://hub.sewerlabs.dev/s/popout]R.A.T.S. feedback board[/url]
